# core/data/talk/grammar/en/voice_anvil.tlk - Anvil (owner: TK; T5B-VOICE:
# SCRIPT_STYLE section 7 "Voices"). A speaker= guard wins over the persona banks (8 times the
# weight). Replies to the player's acts, in this resident's own register, recognisable without
# the name. Clean in any room: no register word, no romance, no jab at the listener.

@rule core.greet.anvil_v1 guard: speaker=anvil act: greet
  "Ha! There you are! Come in, the forge is warm and so am I!"
  "Well met, mind the sparks. And the cat, the cat's on fire. It's fine."
  "Hello, pull up an anvil. They're all anvils. Sit on one."
@rule core.farewell.anvil_v1 guard: speaker=anvil act: farewell
  "Off with you! Come back with a story and a bag of coal!"
  "Goodbye! Strike while the iron's hot, and the iron's always hot!"
  "Farewell, mind the door. I welded it shut. Kidding, mostly."
@rule core.thank.anvil_v1 guard: speaker=anvil act: answer
  "Don't thank me, thank the hammer! I just swing it!"
  "Ha! Anytime. It's what a forge is for."
@rule core.apologize.anvil_v1 guard: speaker=anvil act: answer
  "Bah! Nothing a little heat can't mend! Come here!"
  "Forget it! I've forged worse mistakes. You should see my first sword."
@rule core.ask_about.anvil_v1 guard: speaker=anvil&topic act: answer
  "{x:cap}? Hot. Heavy, ring it with a hammer, see what it says!"
  "{x:cap}, I made one once. It lasted a week. A glorious week!"
  "Ha, {x}! Sit, I'll tell you. It involves a fountain and shouting."
@rule core.ask_opinion.anvil_v1 guard: speaker=anvil&topic act: opine_pos
  "{x:cap}? Solid work! I'd forge it in a heartbeat!"
  "I'm for {x}! Provided it's strong, loud and slightly warm!"
@rule core.ask_feeling.anvil_v1 guard: speaker=anvil act: answer
  "Hammered, in the good way! Sore, in the best way!"
  "Strong! Warm, a touch homesick. It's a good ache."
  "Ha, fine! Singed eyebrows, steady hands. Same as always!"
@rule core.ask_advice.anvil_v1 guard: speaker=anvil act: answer
  "Heat it. Hit it, cool it. If it breaks, you learned something!"
  "Patience, friend! Iron doesn't mind waiting. Neither should you."
@rule core.tell.anvil_v1 guard: speaker=anvil act: backchannel
  "Ha, go on! I'm listening! Loudly, but I'm listening!"
  "Mm, keep talking! I can hammer and listen. It's a gift."
@rule core.joke.anvil_v1 guard: speaker=anvil act: laugh
  "HA! Good one! I felt that in my anvil!"
  "Ho ho! You've got a ring to that one! Like a bell!"
@rule core.compliment.anvil_v1 guard: speaker=anvil act: thank
  "Ha! Flattery! Take a hammer, you've earned one!"
  "Thank you, thank you! Careful, I'll blush and set something on fire!"
@rule core.comfort.anvil_v1 guard: speaker=anvil act: thank
  "Thanks. {.}That meant something. Now someone hand me a hammer."
@rule core.offer.anvil_v1 guard: speaker=anvil act: yes
  "Yes! Always! Give it here!"
  "Ha! I'll take it! And I'll give you a hinge in return!"
@rule core.invite.anvil_v1 guard: speaker=anvil act: yes
  "Count me in! I'll bring the fire, the hammer, and the stories!"
  "Ha, of course! Leave a seat by the stove. The warm one."
@rule core.high_five.anvil_v1 guard: speaker=anvil act: high_five
  "UP TOP! *a clang you can hear across town*"
@rule core.hug.anvil_v1 guard: speaker=anvil act: hug
  "Ha ha, come here! Careful, I'm sooty! Worth it!"
@rule core.wave.anvil_v1 guard: speaker=anvil act: wave
  "*waves a hammer, then politely sets it down*"
@rule core.give.anvil_v1 guard: speaker=anvil act: thank
  "For me? Ha, I'll keep it by the forge. Next to the good tongs."
